Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,CRM tab ka pehla section — Outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.65,0:00:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaha aapke sabhi customers ki current outstanding dikhti hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Har row mein customer name ledger group opening balance total sales paid amount
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.16,0:00:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,aur outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Right side mein aging buckets — 0 to 30 din, 30 to 60, 60 to 90, aur 90 plus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeh sabse important number hai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.84,0:00:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,90 plus days ki outstanding matlab payment collection problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.05,0:00:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Upar dropdown hai — All Customers ya ek specific ledger group ya state select kariye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.83,0:00:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Excel export bhi hai — poori list ek click mein.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.09,0:00:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Salesman ko share kariye — payment collection ka focus milega.
